From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SnowBall Contributors <dev@snowballmc.org>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add restricted parallel world tick pilot

Run complete ServerLevel ticks on a fixed pool only for verified idle worlds
on a player- and plugin-free dedicated server. Keep normal world ticks in
order and run global server phases only after the world worker barrier.
The Moonrise idle invariant and exact world ownership are supplied by 0163.

Design reference: Leaf d65e8b9c0bc383bbc9f2a5a91c363e0662544108, server
patches 0174/0045, and SparklyPaper a274e6617255a93d567efdf00762e492aa2df535
(MrPowerGamerBR and contributors; MIT). SnowBall reimplements a restricted
pilot rather than copying Leaf's compatibility bypasses.

